<p>An avalanche in South Tyrol in northern Italy killed two skiers and injured five others, according to multiple reports. About 25 skiers were on the mountainside when the slide hit, and most managed to get clear, which limited the toll despite the number of people in the area. The avalanche struck in South Tyrol, part of Italy&#x27;s Trentino-Alto Adige region.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/rs7GBDw2PSczdUsKpPjcuDvF7KT-ZgakKWG7fi5CPNwnYWkR0sAtBP7iS4GzQhuKAUN1hEee53BphUH-RDzs9sJeSDQxA_nv-PvvXsq8LRwbujvTnsHFpp4Fe961phUl9kp7Jg0BH3b4mJMvRfrlJJWHyHtzH7tRaE_4Q84GRw' alt='' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Site description: ABC said the avalanche swept across a busy high-alpine slope, suggesting the area was actively in use when the slide hit.</li><li>Named locality: CTV News said the avalanche happened near Ratschings in South Tyrol.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/two-skiers-killed-five-hurt-in-northern-italy-avalanche'>Two skiers killed, five hurt in northern Italy avalanche</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/deadly-south-tyrol-avalanche-kills-2-skiers-trapping-131288476'>A deadly South Tyrol avalanche kills 2 skiers, trapping 25 near the Austria border</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/skiers-killed-hurt-northern-italy-avalanche/'>2 skiers killed, 5 hurt in northern Italy avalanche</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ctvnews.ca/world/article/a-deadly-south-tyrol-avalanche-kills-2-skiers-trapping-25-near-the-austria-border/'>Two skiers are killed and 25 others are trapped, including five injured, in an avalanche near Ratschings in South Tyrol, Italy.</a> - ctvnews.ca</li></ul>